# Trivy allowlist for the GHCR image scan (issue #34).
#
# One CVE id (or GHSA id) per line. Only add an entry here after triaging the
# finding — e.g. it's a false positive, unexploitable in how we use the
# dependency, or a fix isn't available yet and the risk is accepted.
# Include a comment with the justification and, ideally, a tracking issue.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2023-12345 # exp:2026-12-31 — no fix yet upstream, not reachable from our code path (#NN)
